WEBVTT

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.850
by vlooimarkte en afslagwinkels.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.190
Ag, baie dankie.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.010
Om tweedehandse klere te koop

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.400
help om die impak

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.120
wat my klerekas op die omgewing

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:42.130
en op my beursie het, te verminder.

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:44.690
Ek ontmoet allerhande fantastiese mense;

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.450
my geld ondersteun meestal ’n goeie doel;

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.390
ek lyk beslis uniek;

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:52.880
en inkopies-doen is soos 
my persoonlike skattejag.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.750
Ek bedoel, wat gaan ek vandag vind?

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.690
Gaan dit my pas?

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.970
Sal ek van die kleur hou?

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:01.470
Sal dit minder as $20 wees?